00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.700
♪ Climbing down, climbing up ♪

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.370
♪ Even if I get lost ♪

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.000
♪ You stretch out your hand ♪

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.830
♪ Believing in me ♪

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.620
♪ And after going from one place to another ♪

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:13.830
♪ We can meet ♪

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:18.540
<i>This is the Magic for your "Switch"</i>

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:32.000
<i>When you're hanging your head down</i> despondent, my girl, sorry for noticing

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:34.870
<i>Don't smile vaguely</i>

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>Come here</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>Come by my side</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.580
<i>With a soft, shy look</i>

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:41.830
<i>Because humming</i>

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:43.040
<i>The harmony</i>

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:47.370
<i>Will make our body temperature go up a little</i>

00:22:47.370 --> 00:22:48.870
<i>(Sing the song)</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>I want to help you</i>

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:54.290
<i>I want to be your strength</i>

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>Words by themselves sound fake, huh?</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:00.000
<i>How about some magic like this, then?</i>

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.830
<i>Watch carefully without looking away</i>

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:05.750
<i>I'll push the "Switch" to change the world</i>

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:09.660
<i>The sky looks the same as always</i>

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:11.450
<i>I wonder about that</i>

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:15.910
<i>It should already look different to your eyes</i> (Just for you)

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.370
<i>It should be different</i>

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.750
<i>That's right, Magic for your "Switch"</i>

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:22.870
<i>Even if you're Cinderella</i>

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:25.000
<i>Don't worry</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:25.950
<i>It'll be fine</i>

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:31.290
<i>Our magic spell won't be broken</i>

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:34.160
<i>It continues, and that's why it's Happy Magic</i>

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>It won't go away</i>

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.950
<i>It'll protect your smile forever</i>

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:49.000
